  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A distant galaxy is moving towards Earth at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\\: \\textup{km\\,s}^{-1}\"></span>. Monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"500\\:\\textup{nm}\"></span> is emitted by the galaxy.</p>\n<p>What is true about the wavelength shift and what is the wavelength as detected by an observer on Earth?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Wavelength shift</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Detected wavelength</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Red-shifted</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"500.5\\:\\textup{nm}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Red-shifted</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"499.5\\:\\textup{nm}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Blue-shifted</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"500.5\\:\\textup{nm}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Blue-shifted</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"499.5\\:\\textup{nm}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
